// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Anton_Sampson 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Anton Sampson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1746675421" "Anton Sampson"
// ProfessionString :
"P3411635124" "Research Technician"
// DescriptionString :
"P3048010594" "Anton Sampson used to be one of the leading researchers in the field of nanotechnology, but he's fallen on hard times. Just as he was nearing a breakthrough in his latest project, his laboratory was ransacked by Nemesis agents. The attack left his equipment in a shambles and Anton in a full body cast for several months. Since then, he's dedicated himself to collecting information about their activities and feeding it to the heroes of Paragon City. No one is certain what became of the project Anton was working on, and he hasn't spoken about it since the day of the Nemesis attack."
// HelloString :
"P3208392818" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Nemesis must be stopped.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3799942986" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Nemesis activity is increasing.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1160928519" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Someone has to teach Nemesis a lesson.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P972515163" "We are not acquainted. Go speak with {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3748442419" "With groups like Nemesis around, the greatest achievements in the world can be wiped away in an instant. I hope you will help me put a stop to them."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3543066265" "I have no more tasks for you. It may be time for me to go back to my research."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P2572716149" "I appreciate your passion for your work, but, {HeroName}, there's no need to take on so much!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P835345134" "I'd like to see you reach Security Level {Level}. Dealing with Nemesis is no piece of cake."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1380433516" "Thank you for all your help, friend. I think these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> may show you how grateful I am. I want you to call if I can ever assist you."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P205039380" "I know I can trust your discretion, {HeroName}. These new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> should help you keep fighting the good fight."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3737799202" "You need to move on to other troubles. Thank you for your help against Nemesis."
// LocationString :
"P1403482863" "Founders' Falls"
// IntroString :
"P114259262" "If you are looking for someone who has information on Nemesis, you should speak to Anton Sampson. He is an expert in nanotechnology, and he loves working with technological heroes. Anton has access to Invention and Gadget Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3628203469" "Choose Anton Sampson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2683465486" "There have been some strange stories about Anton since he became obsessed with Nemesis, but he provides extremely detailed information."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P2679396721" "An <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associate</A> of mine asked me to send you around."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3922094938" "Some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> are interested in speaking to you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


