// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Colleen Nelson 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2453157790" "Colleen Nelson"
// ProfessionString :
"P2523989338" "Assistant District Attorney"
// DescriptionString :
"P394948031" "Up until very recently, Colleen Nelson was an extremely high paid attorney. She worked for Pinckney & Sons, a notorious law firm that occasionally defends the Council against charges of vandalism and sabotage. Colleen was right in the middle of one such case when she quit, accepting a job at the district attorney's office along with a severe salary cut. No one can get her to talk about the reasons behind her resignation, but in the months since, she's been whole-heartedly dedicated to taking on the Council. No single person has done more to damage the mysterious group, with the possible exception of Manticore, one of Colleen's closest associates."
// HelloString :
"P4118423064" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some cases for you to peruse.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P717779765" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Some interesting cases have come to my attention.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P612113452" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I need your assistance, {HeroName}.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3749468647" "You are talking to the wrong person. You want {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P552553865" "With your help, I hope to gather enough evidence to shut down the Council for good."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1872782003" "I have no more cases to offer you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3333160483" "I appreciate your commitment to justice, but I can't give you another case until you clear out some of that backlog."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P758109469" "Do me a favor and get to Security Level {Level}. There are dangerous times ahead."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P4251741722" "I think I've finally found a friend in this crazy city. I hope these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> will keep you safe out there. You can have my private number."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1980962344" "Trust doesn't come easily to me, but I trust you, {HeroName}. Can you use any of these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements?</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P895055129" "You have grown beyond me, {HeroName}. But I'll always be here if you need to see a friendly face."
// LocationString :
"P1230199062" "Brickstown"
// IntroString :
"P2940173527" "Colleen Nelson is a top notch lawyer who recently joined the district attorney's office. She has dedicated herself to bringing down the Council. She usually works with mutants and can provide Focus and Genetic Alteration Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P666384908" "Choose Colleen Nelson"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1612948937" "Colleen is a rising star in the legal world. I think you two will work together well."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1658982204" "An <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associate</A> of mine has been asking to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P44357296" "I think you could use some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


