// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Ginger_Yates 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Ginger Yates 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P858570972" "Ginger Yates"
// ProfessionString :
"P2983061437" "Ecologist"
// DescriptionString :
"P1590428661" "Ginger Yates is a brilliant ecologist who came to Paragon City full of enthusiasm for studying the Devouring Earth. She began collecting test subjects and logging data, but it wasn't long before tragedy wiped the eager gleam from her eyes. A young hero named Torque had decided that Ginger's activities were a little too dangerous for his town, and he invaded her lab, determined to destroy her test subjects. But he wasn't prepared for the stength and desperation of the cornered creatures, and the battle raged out of control. When the dust settled, Torque was dead, along with Ginger's husband and daughter. She is now grimly determined to use her knowledge to help heroes destroy what she came here to research."
// HelloString :
"P1363109592" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have to stop these monsters.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P2056174015" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The threat never seems to end.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3520243968" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I won't rest until the Devouring Earth is finished.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P218473789" "I'm afraid I can't help you. Go speak to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P593350133" "There is no time for idle chit-chat."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P50306344" "Thank you so much for your efforts. I have no more tasks for you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P225093834" "You're already overworked, {HeroName}."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3352705280" "You'll have to reach Security Level {Level} before we can discuss your next task."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3773973610" "You are a good friend. I wish you had been around years ago. It is my pleasure to provide you with these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A> It might be nice if you gave me a call sometime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4059753147" "I trust that you will not stop until the Devouring Earth are finished. I thank you for that. Please, take all the <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> you need."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3147494226" "You must carry the fight elsewhere. Thank you for all you have done for me."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P2032394832" "Ginger Yates is an ecologist who lost her family to the Devouring Earth. She's pretty grim, but her information is the best. She likes working with science heroes, and she has access to Invention and Genetic Alteration Enhancements"
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2744409383" "Choose Ginger Yates"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2635688197" "She has faced great adversity and is still fighting. Don't be put off by her brusque manner."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4101035596" "One of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> would like to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3672956856" "Some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts</A> of mine have been angling for an introduction."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


