// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Gordon Stacy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1865231681" "Gordon Stacy"
// ProfessionString :
"P309259425" "Police Captain"
// DescriptionString :
"P1641070460" "Captain Gordon Stacy is one of the best and brightest that the Paragon City police force has ever fielded. In his younger days he worked a beat in Crey's Folley, helping to protect the Crey factories from vandalism and theft. But after busting up a few too many shady deals on Crey property, he became suspiscious. Recently he has been very vocal in his condemnation of the corporate giant, an unpopular attitude that nearly cost him his promotion to captain."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P4291943937" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's show these people that they aren't untouchable.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P3869228254" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some good leads for you, {HeroName}.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P942537144" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Crey is at it again.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2689672954" "You should still be talking to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4229550288" "I know your reputation, {HeroName}. I hope I can count on you to help me convince the doubters that Crey is corrupt."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P4188925444" "I have nothing more for you to investigate, {HeroName}. Thanks for all your help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1709591416" "I hope you're planning to clear your caseload soon. I can't give you any more missions until you do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P859966721" "The department's marked my next file classified. Guess we'll have to wait until you get to Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P867934020" "With Crey as an enemy, it's good to have friends like you. The department has made some new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> available to you. Please call if you are ever in need."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P786741174" "You are one of the few people I trust completely, {HeroName}. I think I can let you take a look at all our best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</A>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1809679857" "You have to take the fight elsewhere, {HeroName}. Thanks for all your assistance."
// IntroString :
"P487680409" "Captain Gordon Stacy could really use your help. He has made himself unpopular by investigating Crey, and I'm sure he'd appreciate some back up. He works mostly with natural heroes and can offer Gadget and Relic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P762753843" "Choose Gordon Stacy"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1954207232" "Crey is a very dangerous opponent, {HeroName}. Be ready for anything."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4119286404" "I have a <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>buddy</A> I'd like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P3706455638" "You should meet some of my other <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>contacts.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


