// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Steven Sheridan 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1757701788" "Steven Sheridan"
// ProfessionString :
"P613835953" "Scientist"
// DescriptionString :
"P461112196" "When Dr Steven 'Science' Sheridan was young, his parents thought him a brilliant child prodigy. As it turned out, they had greatly underestimated their son. Some people think he's a mutant; others suspect he's the product of genetic engineering. Either way, he's without a doubt the most knowledgeable human being who ever lived. 'Doc Science' never forgets a single fact; once he learns something, it is locked in his memory forever. His great intellect allows him to easily recall these facts and draw inferences from them; as one might imagine, this makes him one heck of a scientist."
// HelloString :
"P3201031254" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have more Rikti activity to report.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P966264961" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We have to stop the Rikti.</A>"
// HelloString :
"P1545965250" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I have some data you may find interesting, {HeroName}.</A>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4081736340" "Have we met? I believe you should be speaking to {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3737206101" "I am glad you agreed to speak with me, {HeroName}. I believe the Rikti may be the greatest threat facing Paragon City."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P38931465" "Thanks for all your help, but I've got nothing more to report."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1992934572" "You need to spend less time looking for missions and more time completing them."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3374187754" "I have something, but it's a little too dangerous for someone below Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P1916050549" "My science and your abilities are a powerful combination, my friend. I found some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> while I was cleaning out the lab. Hope they'll help. Call me anytime."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P846455700" "With someone I trust at my side, I believe we may lick this Rikti problem yet. I hope these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</A> will help in that regard."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3399882546" "Time for you to help others, {HeroName}."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P4049428144" "Dr. Steven 'Science' Sheridan has asked to speak with you. He has more information on the Rikti than anyone in Paragon City. He also has Relic, Focus, Gadget, Invention, and Genetic Alteration Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1694161353" "Choose Doc Science"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P399046471" "Most people say that Doc Science is the smartest man on the planet. You will learn a lot working with him."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P74081739" "A <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>colleague</A> of mine has been wanting to meet you."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P342499499" "I'd like you to introduce yourself to some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>associates.</A>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

